      "html": "<section class=\"slide\" style=\"padding-top:10cqi\">\n    <div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;pointer-events:none;opacity:.25;z-index:0;background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(26,26,26,.05) 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(26,26,26,.05) 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:6cqi 6cqi;mask-image:radial-gradient(ellipse at center,black 35%,transparent 80%);-webkit-mask-image:radial-gradient(ellipse at center,black 35%,transparent 80%)\"></div>\n    <div style=\"font-size:2cqi;font-weight:700;color:#B5392A;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:1.2cqi\">Problem · Solution</div>\n    <h2 style=\"font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:5.2cqi;font-weight:900;line-height:1.1;color:#111;margin:0 0 2cqi\">原版 vs <span style=\"color:#B5392A\">升级版</span></h2>\n    <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1.5cqi;flex:1\">\n      <div style=\"border:2px solid #1a1a1a;border-radius:1.5cqi;padding:2cqi 2.5cqi;background:#fff;flex:1\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:1.6cqi;font-weight:700;color:#888;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;margin-bottom:.8cqi\">原版 Karpathy</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:2.5cqi;font-weight:900;color:#111;margin-bottom:.5cqi\">一次性写入</div>\n        <p style=\"font-size:2cqi;color:#555;line-height:1.55;margin:0\">采集 → 转写 → 存档，错了就错了。没有回路，没有修正机制，笔记越多越混乱。</p>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"border:2px solid #B5392A;border-radius:1.5cqi;padding:2cqi 2.5cqi;background:rgba(181,57,42,.08);flex:1\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:1.6cqi;font-weight:700;color:#B5392A;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;margin-bottom:.8cqi\">升级 v2</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:2.5cqi;font-weight:900;color:#111;margin-bottom:.5cqi\">反馈闭环</div>\n        <p style=\"font-size:2cqi;color:#555;line-height:1.55;margin:0\">AI 使用知识库时记录每次 miss / 幻觉 / 过期事实，自动回灌到源文件，让笔记会自我修正。</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"display:flex;gap:2cqi;margin-top:1.5cqi;font-size:1.7cqi;color:#666\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.8cqi\"><span style=\"width:1.6cqi;height:1.6cqi;border:2px solid #1a1a1a;border-radius:.4cqi;flex:none\"></span>普通节点</div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.8cqi\"><span style=\"width:1.6cqi;height:1.6cqi;border:2px solid #B5392A;border-radius:.4cqi;background:#B5392A;flex:none\"></span>反馈回路入口</div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.8cqi\">—— 数据流 &nbsp; ┈┈ 反馈</div>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"position:absolute;left:4.5cqi;right:4.5cqi;bottom:3cqi;font-size:1.7cqi;color:#666;letter-spacing:.15em;text-transform:uppercase;border-top:1px solid #cec8be;padding-top:1.5cqi;display:flex;justify-content:space-between\"><span>Content · Compare</span><span>04 / 07</span></div>\n  </section>"
