      "html": "<section class=\"slide\" style=\"padding-top:10cqi\">\n    <div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;pointer-events:none;opacity:.25;z-index:0;background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(26,26,26,.05) 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(26,26,26,.05) 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:6cqi 6cqi;mask-image:radial-gradient(ellipse at center,black 35%,transparent 80%);-webkit-mask-image:radial-gradient(ellipse at center,black 35%,transparent 80%)\"></div>\n    <div style=\"font-size:2cqi;font-weight:700;color:#B5392A;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:1.2cqi\">Implementation · Skill Manifest</div>\n    <h2 style=\"font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:5.2cqi;font-weight:900;line-height:1.1;color:#111;margin:0 0 1.5cqi\">反馈回路 <span style=\"color:#B5392A\">怎么实现</span></h2>\n    <p style=\"font-size:2cqi;color:#555;line-height:1.55;margin:0 0 1.5cqi\">一个 100 行的 Agent Skill，把「AI 用得顺不顺」回写成 vault 的修订记录。</p>\n    <pre style=\"background:#1a1a1a;color:#f0eae0;border-radius:1.5cqi;padding:2cqi 2.5cqi;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:2cqi;line-height:1.8;border:2px solid #1a1a1a;overflow:auto;flex:1\"><span style=\"color:#7a766c\"># skills/wiki-feedback/SKILL.md</span>\n<span style=\"color:#e8a87c;font-weight:700\">name</span>: wiki-feedback\n<span style=\"color:#e8a87c;font-weight:700\">trigger</span>: <span style=\"color:#b3d1bc\">\"after every retrieval\"</span>\n\n<span style=\"color:#e8a87c;font-weight:700\">on_hit</span>:     record(<span style=\"color:#b3d1bc\">query, path, used=true</span>)\n<span style=\"color:#e8a87c;font-weight:700\">on_miss</span>:    record(<span style=\"color:#b3d1bc\">query, reason=</span><span style=\"color:#B5392A\">\"not-in-vault\"</span>)\n<span style=\"color:#e8a87c;font-weight:700\">on_wrong</span>:   record(<span style=\"color:#b3d1bc\">query, correction, path</span>)\n\n<span style=\"color:#e8a87c;font-weight:700\">nightly</span>:\n  - <span style=\"color:#b3d1bc\">aggregate misses → suggest new notes</span>\n  - <span style=\"color:#b3d1bc\">aggregate wrongs → diff-patch notes</span>\n  - <span style=\"color:#b3d1bc\">commit to git, open PR for review</span></pre>\n    <div style=\"position:absolute;left:4.5cqi;right:4.5cqi;bottom:3cqi;font-size:1.7cqi;color:#666;letter-spacing:.15em;text-transform:uppercase;border-top:1px solid #cec8be;padding-top:1.5cqi;display:flex;justify-content:space-between\"><span>Content · Code</span><span>05 / 07</span></div>\n  </section>"
